TI  - A Bootstrapping Convolutional Neural Network Technique for Optimizing Automated Detection of Equatorial Plasma Bubbles by Optical All-Sky Imagers
AU  - Okoh, Daniel
AU  - Cesaroni, Claudio
AU  - Rabiu, Babatunde
AU  - Shiokawa, Kazuo
AU  - Otsuka, Yuichi
AU  - Ogunjo, Samuel
AU  - Akerele, Aderonke
